{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_1000_situation", "source_sha256": "c26b52724288b57acdaa350cfef2b3325420862e54118b414a7ec73f16aeec57", "ja": "ファンイベントのお仕事", "zh": "粉丝活动的工作", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_1000_place", "source_sha256": "52ecda82ee55e882db174e3a942fadef5f11215c5aa495a4a67cf0146088d876", "ja": "ステージ袖", "zh": "舞台侧边", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "7dc58625746e0553544475f6de03c562d8f13b2676441a77fdd17f77e4da46f9", "ja": "{$P$}さん、今日のイベント、時間に\n余裕ありませんか？　ちょっとでいいんですけど……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，今天活动有空档吗？\n只要一下子就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4b51e22727d7f043bd4cfe8cf668b84f881625107c8b29bbc0f76a383ac98c29", "ja": "ええと……タイムテーブルだと、10分くらいなら\n余裕があるかな。でも、急にどうしたんだ？", "zh": "呃……以时间表来看的话，大概有十分钟左右的空档。\n不过，怎么突然这么问？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "f3596d430c7c55350981fc994094c9c4aa430b1e48c639dd93379ec1d0fb3bb0", "ja": "はい！　実はありさ、ファンの皆さんに、\nお手紙を書いてきたんです。", "zh": "是的！其实亚利沙\n写了信要给粉丝们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "a2c9e0e4ee8aa0f7d0e65cee424e3a7a2e7f177d6f9cc1c60bff2435f099c562", "ja": "ありさ、アイドルちゃんとしてはまだまだですケド……\n皆さんのお手紙から、いっぱい元気をもらったので。", "zh": "虽然亚利沙作为偶像宝贝还有很多需要成长的地方……\n但是大家的信让亚利沙获得了满满的活力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "ee6b622fa2eeff1915cea89468f896d04d45903e7e845e73b3d1c96947f8b502", "ja": "だから今度は、ありさが、お手紙でも！\n元気をあげられたら、って思ったんです！", "zh": "所以这次亚利沙希望也能透过书信\n将活力分给大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b141f7cb8547a38dbf54afb0f973595445a27a293363976f39a92609149dab4c", "ja": "それは、いい考えだな！\nよし、さっそく調整しよう。", "zh": "那个想法很不错！\n好，我马上来调整时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
